or our favorite game\n[01:44.50]Black and gold, we wave the flag\n[01:46.82]This one's for my family name\n[01:49.01]With pride I wear it to the grave\n[02:12.91][03:30.58][03:48.03]I've got your name written here,\n[02:29.47]This one means the most to me\n[02:31.66]Stays here for eternity\n[02:33.26]A ship that always stays the course\n[02:35.69]An anchor for my every choice\n[02:37.88]A rose that shines down from above\n[02:40.06]I signed and sealed these words in blood\n[02:42.43]I heard them once, sung in a song\n[02:44.44]It played again and we sang along\n[02:55.87]You'll always be here with me\n[02:57.92]Even if you're gone\n[03:00.11]You'll always have my love\n[03:02.16]Our memory will live on\n[03:17.45]I've got your name written here in a rose tattoo\n[03:39.28]With pride I'll wear it to the grave for you\n[03:56.78]Signed and sealed in blood I would die for you\n","_id":"6xRdxu138TTgCWMc"}
