{"id":16901,"volId":885,"name":"Sleepless","artist":"Adept","album":"Sleepless","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/10540/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio854/11.mp3","color":"#545d64","lyric":"[by:11120121112012]\n[00:00.00]\n[00:32.61]I'm standing on the edge of life\n[00:34.89]With one foot in the air\n[00:35.81]And the other one on the solid ground\n[00:37.55]\n[00:38.41]I always lived like there's no tomorrow\n[00:40.03]But lately I live like there's no today\n[00:42.42]And I can't think of a reason for me to stay\n[00:44.30]\n[00:46.57]Winter came and we follow the seasons\n[00:48.80]We grew colder without a reason\n[00:50.77]We should've kept this warmth and instead we choose to bear on\n[00:53.85]\n[00:54.46]And I just can't sleep\n[00:56.12]Not after this\n[00:57.07]\n[01:01.32]The picture of us is fading\n[01:02.52]Like the leafs on trees with hands of fall\n[01:04.84]\n[01:05.10]In the end when we'll be left\n[01:06.20]Will you remember me at all?\n[01:07.64]\n[01:08.39]When you're longer out of lessons\n[01:09.70]We keep fighting the hands of time\n[01:11.41]Because time here is off the essence\n[01:13.33]\n[01:15.21]I remember that time so pure and I want it back\n[01:17.59]Because I miss the feeling of being secure\n[01:19.36]\n[01:20.94]So hear my voice through the echoes\n[01:22.66]Through the subtle wave of the discord\n[01:24.44]It's a drop in the sea\n[01:26.09]But it's so important that you hear me\n[01:27.70]\n[01:30.03]The sun never felt so cold\n[01:31.66]How can it glow when it feels so dead\n[01:34.09]How can we love when we hate instead\n[01:36.11]\n[01:36.97]Our passion was supposed to be timeless\n[01:38.74]I left my heart being restless and sleepless\n[01:42.14]\n[01:42.63]You want forgiveness?\n[01:43.90]Now I want time to go backwards\n[01:45.62]To take back the years\n[01:46.89]I gave away to someone who's heartless\n[01:48.85]\n[01:49.35]Well maybe I don't deserve to be happy\n[01:51.42]But since you missed your loved so company\n[01:53.21]\n[01:53.49]Why don't you stick around with me?\n[01:54.76]And what you promise me from the start\n[01:56.62]You break as easily as my heart\n[01:58.54]\n[02:00.37]So come and watch me fall apart\n[02:02.05]\n[02:04.26]Are you listening?\n[02:07.02]Can you hear me out in this song?\n[02:10.55]Let me open my heart, let me tell you\n[02:13.73]All the way from right to wrong\n[02:16.82]\n[02:18.54]Am I the one to blame?\n[02:21.46]Did I start this fire by myself?\n[02:25.41]Am I supposed to dream when these nights without you\n[02:30.24]Leave me sleepless\n[02:32.22]\n[02:33.64]I just can't sleep\n[02:36.36]Not after this\n[02:37.89]Not after this\n[02:38.53]\n[02:45.86]Sing it!\n[02:46.97]\n[02:47.64]Oooo....\n[02:49.73]\n[02:52.24]I can't sleep with these voices inside\n[02:55.83]I can't bear on this voice of regret\n[02:59.21]I can't stop till you do this time\n[03:01.74]\n[03:07.30]Put your hand on my mouth so I sleep\n[03:10.23]Take my breath away\n[03:12.31]Like you always did\n[03:14.23]Come cover me so I can sleep\n[03:16.35]\n[03:17.81]I am sick and tired and weak\n[03:21.25]I am hopeless and fragile and freaked\n[03:24.93]Will you sing me to sleep in the end\n[03:28.72]Will it ever end?\n[03:30.80]\n[03:32.27]I am sick and tired and weak\n[03:35.90]I am hopeless and fragile and freaked\n[03:39.49]Will you sing me to sleep in the end\n[03:43.29]Will it ever end?\n","_id":"7zppSJ2TB2spcE4D"}
