ow you feel like you are breaking down.\n[02:17.66]I know that it gets so hard sometimes,\n[02:23.19]Be calm.\n[02:24.91]Take it from me, I've been there a thousand times.\n[02:28.53]You hate your pulse because it thinks you're still alive\n[02:31.75]And everything's wrong\n[02:34.05]It just gets so hard sometimes\n[02:37.95]Be calm.\n[02:40.00]I don't remember much that night,\n[02:43.76]Just walking, thinking fondly of you\n[02:47.70]Thinking how the worst is yet to come\n[02:52.21]When from that street corner came a song\n[02:55.77]And I can't remember the man,\n[02:58.53]The panhandler or his melody.\n[03:02.20]The words exchanged had far exceeded any change I'd given thee.\n[03:14.89]Oh be calm.\n[03:16.72]Be calm.\n[03:18.34]I know you feel like you are breaking down.\n[03:22.46]I know that it gets so hard sometimes,\n[03:27.84]Be calm.\n[03:29.45]Take it from me, I've been there a thousand times.\n[03:33.18]You hate your pulse because it thinks you're still alive\n[03:36.34]And everything's wrong\n[03:38.56]It just gets so hard sometimes\n[03:42.61]Be calm...\n[03:46.32]\n","_id":"E2syBppDTez3ykLy"}
