{"id":7482,"volId":244,"name":"Those Were The Days","artist":"Turisas","album":"SvartDance I","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/2847/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio269/01.mp3","color":"","lyric":"[by:孔雀王乚]\n[00:00.00]\n[00:16.63]\n[00:18.33]Once upon a time there was a tavern,\n[00:24.17]Where we used to raise a glass or two.\n[00:29.96]Remember how we laughed away the hours,\n[00:35.89]And think of all the great things we would do.\n[00:44.17]\n[00:44.29]Those were the days my friend,\n[00:47.27]We thought they'd never end,\n[00:49.10]We'd sing and dance for-ever and a day,\n[00:52.54]We'd live the life we choose,\n[00:54.26]We'd fight and never lose,\n[00:56.02]For we were young and sure to have our way.\n[00:58.92]\n[00:59.04]Lalala lah lala, lalala lah lala...\n[01:06.47]Lalala lah lala, lalala lah lala...\n[01:14.18]\n[01:14.27]Just tonight I stood before the tavern,\n[01:17.75]Nothing seemed the way it used to be.\n[01:21.17]In the glass I saw a strange reflection,\n[01:24.81]Was that lonely soldier really me.\n[01:28.62]\n[01:28.73]Those were the days my friend,\n[01:31.16]We thought they'd never end,\n[01:32.88]We'd sing and dance for-ever and a day,\n[01:36.38]We'd live the life we choose,\n[01:38.07]We'd fight and never lose,\n[01:39.86]For we were young and sure to have our way.\n[01:42.76]\n[01:42.86]Lalala lah lala, lalala lah lala...\n[01:50.48]Lalala lah lala, lalala lah lala...\n[01:58.27]\n[02:03.85]Hey!   Hey!\n[02:05.50]\n[02:14.09]Through the door there came familiar laughter.\n[02:19.14]I saw your face and heard you call my name.\n[02:24.75]Oh, my friend, we're older but no wiser,\n[02:29.88]For in our hearts the dreams are still the same.\n[02:36.64]\n[02:36.72]Those were the days my friend,\n[02:40.48]We thought they'd never end,\n[02:42.13]We'd sing and dance for-ever and a day,\n[02:45.52]We'd live the life we choose,\n[02:47.30]We'd fight and never lose,\n[02:49.10]For we were young and sure to have our