{"id":540,"volId":281,"name":"Littlest Things","artist":"Lily Allen","album":"Alright,Still","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/516/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio47/02.mp3","color":"","lyric":"[ti:Littlest Things]\r\n[ar:]\r\n[al:]\r\n[by:甘宁]\r\n\r\n[00:01.06]Littlest Things\r\n[00:08.14]甘宁——献给可可（因为你喜欢）\r\n[00:23.79]Sometimes I find myself sittin' back and reminiscing 有时候我发现自己一边放松,一边回忆\r\n[00:27.02]Especially when I have to watch other people kissin'特别是不得不看着别人亲吻的时候\r\n[00:29.52]And I remember when you started callin' me your miss's我还记得,你刚开始称呼我&lt;我的姑娘&gt;的时候\r\n[00:32.27]All the play fightin', all the flirtatious disses 以及所有的调笑和轻浮的纤维\r\n[00:35.48]I'd tell you sad stories about my childhood 我会给你讲我悲惨的童年\r\n[00:38.45]I dont why I trusted you but I knew that I could 虽然不知道为什么,但是直觉告诉我,你是可以相信的\r\n[00:41.25]We'd spend the whole weekend lying in our own dirt 我们以我们自己的方式度过我们整个的周末\r\n[00:44.15]I was just so happy in your boxers and your t-shirt 并且让我沉溺在你的拳击短裤和圆领汗衫里……\r\n[00:46.97]\r\n[00:47.28]Chorus\r\n[00:47.92]Dreams, Dreams 梦想啊梦想\r\n[00:49.84]Of when we had just started things 当我们开始做事的时候\r\n[00:53.12]Dreams of you and me 关于你和我的梦\r\n[00:59.01]It seems, It seems 看起来,\r\n[01:01.50]That I can't shake those memories 我已没有能力撼动那些记忆\r\n[01:04.92]I wonder if you have the same dreams too. 我想知道,你是否和我一样有个这样的梦想\r\n[01:08.38]\r\n[01:10.75]The littlest things that take me there 这微不足道的事情把我带到那里\r\n[01:13.82]I know it sounds lame but its so true我知道这听起来很衰,但是,这是真的\r\n[01:16.97]I know its not right, but it seems unfair 我知道这不对,但它似乎是不公平的\r\n[01:19.66]That the things are reminding me of you那些事情使我记起你\r\n[01:22.60]Sometimes I wish we could just pretend 有时候我都希望我们仅仅是假装一下也好\r\n[01:25.67]Even if for only one weekend 即使为仅仅的一个周末\r\n[01:28.50]So come on, Tell me 到现在这么个境地,告诉我,\r\n[01:30.85]Is this the end? 这算是结束了吗?\r\n[01:33.48]\r\n[01:33.88]Drinkin' tea in bed 躺在床上喝茶\r\n[01:35.54]Watching DVD's 看着DVD\r\n[01:36.99]When I discovered all your dirty grotty magazines 我发现了你所有的下流的难看的杂志\r\n[01:39.83]You take me out shopping and all we'd buy is trainers 你带我出去购物,所有我们买的都是些软运动鞋\r\n[01:42.86]As if we ever needed anything to entertain us 好似我们需要任何什么东西娱乐我们自己一样\r\n[01:45.77]the first time that you introduced me to your friends 你第一次把我介绍给你的朋友们时\r\n[01:48.55]and you could tell I was nervous, so you held my hand 你可能知道我紧张,所以,你握住了我的手\r\n[01:51.48]when I was feeling down, you made that face you do 当我神经不那么紧张,你还对着我扮鬼脸\r\n[01:54.54]no one in the world that could replace you 那个瞬间,让我觉得在这个世上,你是无可替代的.\r\n[01:57.08]\r\n[01:57.42]Chorus\r\n[01:57.89]Dreams, Dreams 梦想啊梦想\r\n[01:59.81]Of when we had just started things 当我们开始做事的时候\r\n[02:03.44]Dreams of me and you 关于你和我的梦\r\n[02:09.17]It seems, It seems 看起来,\r\n[02:11.74]That I can't shake those memories 我已没有能力撼动那些记忆\r\n[02:15.24]I wonder if you feel the same way too 我想知道,你是否和我一样有个这样的梦想\r\n[02:18.78]\r\n[02:20.93]The littlest things that take me there 这微不足道的事情把我带到那里\r\n[02:23.86]I know it sounds lame but its so true 我知道这听起来很衰,但是,这是真的\r\n[02:27.00]I know its not right, but it seems unfair 我知道这不对,但它似乎是不公平的\r\n[02:30.00]That the things remind me of you 那些事情使我记起你\r\n[02:32.85]Sometimes I wish we could just pretend 有时候我都希望我们仅仅是假装一下也好\r\n[02:35.77]Even if for only one weekend  即使为仅仅的一个周末\r\n[02:38.89]So come on, Tell me 到现在这么个境地,告诉我,\r\n[02:41.07]Is this the end?这算是结束了吗?\n","_id":"LLbtnDmIkMsMBowq"}
