{"id":791,"volId":364,"name":"First Day of My Life","artist":"Bright Eyes","album":"I’m Wide Awake, It’s Morning","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/738/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio69/10.mp3","color":"","lyric":"[ti:First Day Of My Life]\r\n[ar:Bright eyes]\r\n[al:I'm Wide Awake, It's Morning]\r\n[by:A-guu]\r\n[00:01.73]First Day Of My Life\r\n[00:02.48]Bright eyes\r\n[00:02.96]edit by A-guu\r\n[00:21.17]This is the first day of my life\r\n[00:26.00]Swear I was born right in the doorway\r\n[00:31.02]I went out in the rain, suddenly everything changed\r\n[00:34.20]They're spreading blankets on the beach\r\n[00:41.23]Yours is the first face that I saw\r\n[00:46.18]I think I was blind before I met you\r\n[00:51.13]I don't know where I am, \r\n[00:51.67]don't know where I've been\r\n[00:54.17]But I know where I want to go\r\n[00:59.15]\r\n[00:59.72]\r\n[01:00.41]So I thought I'd let you know\r\n[01:04.60]That these things take forever,\r\n[01:07.21]I especially am slow\r\n[01:11.38]But I realized how I need you\r\n[01:13.97]And I wondered if I could come home\r\n[01:17.86]\r\n[01:19.17]\r\n[01:27.80]I remember the time you drove all night\r\n[01:32.53]Just to meet me in the morning\r\n[01:37.43]And I thought it was strange, you said everything changed\r\n[01:40.43]You felt as if you'd just woke up\r\n[01:45.05]\r\n[01:46.28]And you said, &quot;This is the first day of my life&quot;\r\n[01:52.32]I'm glad I didn't die before I met you\r\n[01:57.50]But Now I don't care, I could go anywhere with you\r\n[02:01.13]And I'd probably be happy&quot;\r\n[02:05.46]\r\n[02:06.18]\r\n[02:06.70]So if you want to be with me\r\n[02:11.03]With these things there's no telling\r\n[02:13.26]We'll just have to wait and see\r\n[02:16.88]But I'd rather be working for a paycheck\r\n[02:19.99]Than waiting to win the lottery\r\n[02:22.56]\r\n[02:23.91]\r\n[02:27.34]Besides, maybe this time it's different\r\n[02:30.07]I mean I really think you like me\r\n[02