{"id":8068,"volId":83,"name":"Burnt Love Letters [Feat. Zefora]","artist":"Dave Greening","album":"The Midnight Sessions","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/3416/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio401/01.mp3","color":"#666e72","lyric":"[00:00.00] 作曲 : Dave\n[00:01.00] 作词 : Zefora\n[00:14.990]It's been two weeks since your last letter\n[00:18.480]and it feels like an eternity.\n[00:21.530]When I hear the mail arrive,\n[00:23.920]my heart soars as I carefully open the envelope and savor every word. ，\n[00:30.280]It's almost like Christmas.\n[00:33.740]I wish they were all a thousand pages long\n[00:36.580]so that I would never have to stop reading.\n[00:41.470]I went into the city last week and passed by our old building. ，\n[00:47.240]Do you remember when we used to dance on the rooftop at night in the rain, ，\n[00:52.310]and you'd spin me around and my hair would get so wet it would stick to my face ，\n[00:57.360]and you had to push it out of the way just to kiss me?\n[01:01.430]And Mrs. Lourdes would always tell us we were going to catch our death up there as we passed her door on the way downstairs?\n[01:09.780]I miss trying to sneak past her door before racing you down the stairs to our flat.\n[01:18.030]just so that you'd do that silly victory dance.\n[01:18.870]Sometimes I'd let you win\n[01:22.490]I miss the excitement of those nights,\n[01:25.210]even though our clothes were soaked and it was cold. ，\n[01:29.820]I miss dancing with you in the rain.\n[01:34.380]I miss you so much.\n[01:36.790]I can't stop thinking about you.\n[01:39.990]I miss running my fingers through your hair.\n[01:43.200]Standing on tip-toes to reach your lips or\n[01:46.970]singing off key on purpose in the car to annoy Liv.\n[01:52.120]I miss your stupid jokes and the way you absent mindedly push your glasses up your nose while you're working. ，\n[02:00.140]I miss you even when I am sleeping.\n[02:07.140]I lie awake at night in the dark\n[02:10.410]and listen to the rain gently tapping the window pane\n[02:16.160]and I imagine dancing with you again\n[02:19.570]until sleep finally finds me.\n[02:24.080]My heart aches every time I wake to feel your empty place beside me. ，\n[02:30.400]I miss waking up to your smile and your warmth.\n[02:35.450]Please come home safely. I love you.，\n","_id":"VwODnUFAyb0dGYr5"}
