{"id":7990,"volId":76,"name":"Grandfather","artist":"Lorn","album":"Nothing Else","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/3339/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio408/01.mp3","color":"#151515","lyric":"[by:海鸟和鱼的喜剧]\n[00:01.13]When I was born my grandfather\n[00:06.04]held me in his warm hands\n[00:10.47]And it seems though his eyes are teary\n[00:14.75]But it’s hard to tell from an old photograph\n[00:20.21]While my brother and sister danced\n[00:24.42]At the feet of his tired and weathered frame\n[00:30.21]He said there’s a light to this boy I’ve rarely seen\n[00:36.43]And there he gave me my name\n[00:41.85]Well my grandfather was a sniper\n[00:47.13]In the Red Army\n[00:52.05]He never knew brothers in arms\n[00:56.19]From on both side stood enemy\n[01:00.57]Will the cold  unbroken will to survive\n[01:06.48]His steady hand took care\n[01:10.87]And he drank just enough to keep himself warm\n[01:15.36]For he never spoke his true name\n[01:30.55]When I was a boy  the summer were out\n[01:35.03]He would take me down to the sea\n[01:39.81]And standing on the water’s edge\n[01:42.45]And watch me go crazy\n[01:44.45]As the gentle waves rolled in\n[01:49.24]Looking back I wonder how he must have felt\n[01:54.25]Watching me running so free\n[01:58.78]All the years in his life he wished he could forget\n[02:03.39]Did he look at the world through me?\n[02:18.31]When I was a man I flew across the Ocean\n[02:22.85]When I heard he needed care\n[02:27.70]I listened as he spoke of his turbulent life\n[02:32.33]From his ordinary chair\n[02:37.10]And he ended by saying\n[02:39.64]“oh, I’ve had enough\n[02:42.23]The time has come for me to go\n[02:46.82]I have only one wish\n[02:48.88]That is a left in me\n[02:51.55]To be taken peacefully”\n[03:07.30]Just before I was due to marry\n[03:11.43]I heard he could not walk anymore\n[03:16.14]It was then he gave up fight\n[03:18.71]I’ve say goodbye\n[03:21.19]Almost one year before\n[03:25.90]And I’ll never forg