36.870]It's the club, where the guys put on a new persona,\n[02:39.270]they go to looking for beautiful, brainless, bitches like you to bone them.\n[02:46.890]Then when they leave you, you cry and cry;\n[02:48.750]\n[02:49.250]Talking about'OMG,OMG i can't find a guy,\n[02:51.260]it's been so many years and i've tried and tried,\n[02:53.490]why am I even on earth? i should die!'\n[02:56.530]You want romeo?,\n[02:57.550]you're not worthy.\n[02:58.630]You're cock thirsty, nasty and probably got herpes.\n[03:00.970]Sometimes the secret to find,\n[03:02.500]is to stop searching.\n[03:03.540]Try a new formula, Because your last ones not working\n[03:06.040]\n[03:06.650]The term real nigga is publically used,\n[03:08.450]and I need to know what it means because im ****ing confused.\n[03:10.690]Are you one? For always busting your two, with nothing to lose and something to prove, the homies up in your crew.\n[03:15.650]Is it because you're selling drugs to get loot?,\n[03:17.540]and brag about how you been shot and stabbed like it's fun to be you?\n[03:20.370]But your life is a struggle, and you're just hustling through.\n[03:22.880]Nah you hamster ass nigga, you just stuck in a LOOP.\n[03:25.280]Man, why do black people gotta be the only ones who can't evolve?,\n[03:28.140]Because you in the streets acting like neanderthals.\n[03:30.740]It's clear that you can't stand the law,\n[03:33.770]\n[03:34.310]And all you interested in is fighting,rapping and basketball.\n[03:35.690]I can't even **** with you, because if we out in public,\n[03:37.980]he gon' get caught stealing some shit, and get my ass in trouble too.\n[03:40.370]You get old and be nothing, living life in these streets,\n[03:43.050]thugging and starting shit with anybody mean looking.\n[03:45.730]Look at you, a real nigga, thinking you're lifes cool.\n[03:47.710]Girls used to turn me down, for guys who were like you.\n[03:50.030]‘Till you grabbed their heart and shoved a spear head right through,\n[03:52.510]then