hing for more\n[01:43.89]Haters are trife, cause their vision is poor\n[01:46.43]The way of this life, time to settle the score\n[01:49.13]He sent over beats, now they’re getting torn up\n[01:53.27]Parental he just getting warmed up\n[01:55.25][Scratched]\n[02:15.74]Rose from my bed, the words followed after\n[02:18.02]Asked my nigga Will if the bars were a laugher\n[02:20.60]He was like, “Nah nigga that shit’s ill\n[02:23.17]I’ma let my homie Tommy hear you spit for real.”\n[02:25.75]I got a couple beats, crafted the lyrics\n[02:28.43]Told em I was done, he was asking to hear it\n[02:31.01]Heard me kick a rap, on the spot made a pact\n[02:33.58]We would post a bundle of some wonderful tracks\n[02:36.26]We’re doing just that, offshoot was an email\n[02:38.77]Short, to the point, with very little detail\n[02:41.46]Guess who it was? He said the flow was crazy\n[02:43.93]Rob-O, Grap Luva who he worked with lately\n[02:46.61]I was like “Damn, that’s kind of a big deal.”\n[02:49.15]Ever since, been working and keeping it even keel\n[02:51.74]Fans say the beats and the bars are tough\n[02:55.45]To our style, I think they’re warming up\n","_id":"kjszMvimleM4zKOZ"}
