{"id":450,"volId":220,"name":"Mariana","artist":"Childs","album":"Yui","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/albums/346/cover.jpg","url":"http://mp3-cdn2.luoo.net/low/luoo/radio15/03.mp3","color":"","lyric":"[00:01.28]Sound of Music-MARIA\n[00:05.36]She climbs a tree\n[00:06.72]And scrapes her knee\n[00:08.06]Her dress has got a tear.\n[00:10.36]She waltzes on her way to mass\n[00:12.77]And whistles on the stair.\n[00:15.11]And underneath her wimpole\n[00:17.23]She has curlers in her hair!\n[00:20.04]I even herad her singing in the abbey.\n[00:24.63]She's always late for chapel,\n[00:26.98]But her penitence is real.\n[00:29.68]She's always late for everything,\n[00:32.12]Except for every meal.\n[00:34.48]I hate to have to say it,\n[00:36.76]But I very firmly feel\n[00:39.47]Maria's not an asset to the abbey!\n[00:44.39]I'd like to say a word in her behalf.\n[00:49.55]Maria makes me laugh!\n[00:56.35]How do you solve a problem like Maria?\n[01:00.20]How do you catch a cloud and bring it down?\n[01:04.43]How do you find a word that means Maria?\n[01:08.45]A flibberti gibbet!\n[01:09.47]A willo' the wisp!\n[01:10.37]A clown!\n[01:12.70]Many a thing you know you'd like to tell her,\n[01:16.57]Many a thing she ought to understand.\n[01:20.56]But how do you make her stay\n[01:22.53]And listen to all you say,\n[01:24.73]How do you keep a wave upon the sand?\n[01:28.87]Oh, how do you solve a problem like Maria?\n[01:33.50]How do you hold a moonbeam in your hand?\n[01:45.72]When I'm dazed and confused,\n[01:47.37]Out of focus and bemused,\n[01:49.10]And I never know exactly where I am.\n[01:52.99]Unpredictable as weather,\n[01:54.67]She's as flighty as a feather,\n[01:56.58]She's a darling,\n[01:57.55]She's a demon,\n[01:58.60]She's a lamb.\n[02:00.70]She'd out-pester any pest,\n[02:02.40]Drive a hornet from his nest,\n[02:04.12]She could throw a whirling dervish Out of whirl.\n[02:08.05]She is gentle,\n[02:08.95]She is wild,\n[02:09.98]She's a riddle.\n[02:10.83]She's a ch